  "testableAssertions": [
    "Every ownership edge points to one natural owner.",
    "No forbidden dependency edge is present in the implementation mapping.",
    "Coin Card owns identity, transaction, and receipt.",
    "Transfer Portal augments Coin Card but does not route Coin Card payments.",
    "IX_EXECUTE owns wallet, approval, transfer, receipt polling, and fee math.",
    "Identity regions are structural and persist across workflow states.",
    "Workflow regions may change across workflow states.",
